					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205160505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 205160505,
					"content": "#啊，對了，一定是葛瑞絲修女告訴{F#妳}{M#你}的吧，她一直在這附近。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205160506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 205160506,
					"content": "之前我吃的藥，也有很多是她送過來的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205160507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 205160507,
					"content": "葛瑞絲修女真是個好人啊，不過我可不想一直待在蒙德城…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
